                    <p class="ht-timeline-desc">Trainer Marcus Vance approved consultation with client Sarah Jenkins for Friday, 10:00 AM.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="ht-timeline-item">
                    <div class="ht-timeline-dot"></div>
